Subject: [Buildroot] [RFC PATCH v2 6/9] support/scripts: add
	create-sdk-relocation-script for SDK relocation
In-Reply-To: <1489674207-6876-1-git-send-email-wg@grandegger.com>
References: <1489674207-6876-1-git-send-email-wg@grandegger.com>
Message-ID: <1489674207-6876-7-git-send-email-wg@grandegger.com>
